6817,39836822,39846244,39846251,39855657,39855661,39865059,39865065,39874441,39874446,39884034,39884039,39893656,39893661,39903225,39903228,39912873,39912876,39922630,39922631,39932119,39932121,39941719,39941723,39951601,39951604,39961272,39961275,39970772,39970781,39980255,39980257,39989912,39989915,39999448,39999451,40008950,40008954,40018421,40018426,40027922,40027930,40037396,40037399,40046834,40046841,40056350,40056352,40066353,40066356,40075879,40075885,40085349,40085355,40094898,40094900,40104331,40104335,40114010,40114016,40123691,40123696,40133433,40133438,40143054,40143057,40152573,40152577,40162074,40162075,40171406,40171411,40181122,40181123,40190620,40190624,40200137,40200142,40209611,40209618,40219109,40219112,40228598,40228607,40238593,40238596,40248242,40248248,40257893,40257899,40267445,40267452,40277075,40277081,40286657,40286661,40296175,40296181,40305729,40305732,40315289,40315293,40324772,40324778,40334310,40334313,40343869,40343874,40353770,40353777,40363498,40363504,40373417,40373422,40383300,40383303,40395199,40395206,40405255,40405261,40415748,40415753,40426284,40426290,40436949,40436954,40448067,40448070,40460786,40460789,40470974,40470982,40481312,40481318,40491531,40491534,40501739,40501743,40511878,40511884,40522378,40522381,40532762,40532766,40543019,40543021,40553218,40553225,40563437,40563438,40573571,40573575,40583789,40583794,40593972,40593973,40604140,40604143,40614347,40614351,40624469,40624472,40634597,40634604,40644727,40644730,40654808,40654813,40664986,40664990,40675198,40675201,40685276,40685279,40695236,40695238,40705330,40705339,40715428,40715430,40725389,40725392,40735394,40735399,40745428,40745436,40755460,40755463,40765656,40765660,40775833,40775835,40786003,40786006,40796105,40796111,40806039,40806041,40815842,40815847" data-warm-notice-type="error" moduleId="16" documentId="211359">«Как в бухучете отразить командировочные расходы за пределы республики»</a></span></span>»</span>,<br>организуемом <span class="fill">Центром корпоративного управления НИУ «Высшая школа экономики<span id="sfwc_3" class="sfwc"></span><span class="tooltip__wrapper"><span class="tooltip__point no-print"></span><span class="tooltip_text no-print"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201299/dfas7ai0n8/" data-dfa="dfas7ai0n8"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201299/bssPhr1/"></a>Укажите наименование <br><br>организации, организующей семинар</span></span>»</span>, прошу<br>направить <span class="fill">Юсупова Ровшана Нигматовича</span> – главного специалиста Управления корпоративных<br>отношений с акционерами в служебную командировку <span class="fill">г. Москва (Российская Федерация)</span><span id="sfwc_4" class="sfwc"></span><span class="tooltip__wrapper"><span class="tooltip__point no-print"></span><span class="tooltip_text no-print"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201299/dfasevgszv/" data-dfa="dfasevgszv"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201299/bssPhr1/"></a>Укажите город, страну<br><br>командировки укажите ФИО сотрудника, который едет в командировку</span></span>с<br><span class="fill">12.02.2020</span><span class="fill">&nbsp;года</span> по <span class="fill">16.02.2020</span><span id="sfwc_5" class="sfwc"></span><span class="tooltip__wrapper"><span class="tooltip__point no-print"></span><span class="tooltip_text no-print"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201299/dfasvfxlvo/" data-dfa="dfasvfxlvo"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201299/bssPhr1/"></a>Укажите срок<br><br>нахождения в командировке</span></span><span class="fill">&nbsp;года.</span></p><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201299/bssPhr5/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201299/dfaso0nfe5/" data-dfa="dfaso0nfe5"></a>Прилагается: письмо-приглашение от <span class="fill">25.01 2020</span><span class="fill">&nbsp;года.</span></p><div><table width="100%"><tbody><tr><td style="text-align:center;         vertical-align:top"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201299/bssPhr6/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201299/dfasl6dnbp/" data-dfa="dfasl6dnbp"></a>Начальник</td><td class="bdBottom" style="text-align:center;         vertical-align:top"><span class="fill"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201299/bssPhr7/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201299/dfaslchhiz/" data-dfa="dfaslchhiz"></a>Кадыров</span></td><td style="text-align:center;         vertical-align:top"><span class="fill"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201299/bssPhr8/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201299/dfasp3v347/" data-dfa="dfasp3v347"></a>К. Кадыров</span></td></tr><tr><td style="width: 320pt;   text-align: center"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201299/bssPhr9/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201299/dfasbquku2/" data-dfa="dfasbquku2"></a>&nbsp;<span class="fill">06.02.2020</span><span class="fill">&nbsp;г.</span></td><td class="bdTop" style="width: 320pt;   text-align: center"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201299/bssPhr10/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201299/dfaskpgik6/" data-dfa="dfaskpgik6"></a><sup>(подпись)</sup></td><td style="width:320pt"><a data-anchor="/document/118/201299/bssPhr11/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/118/201299/dfasd9mohf/" data-dfa="dfasd9mohf"></a>&nbsp;</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><div class="footer">© Материал из ЭС "ACTION: Главбух"<br />https://1gb.uz<br />Дата копирования: 29.09.2026</div></div></div></div></body></html>